	(text "The 10 kohm pull resistors hold read, write and output-enable controls inactive.\nFT_RST_LOC_N has a pull-up and receives FT_RESET_N through 1 kohm R706.\nFT_GPIO0/1 have pull-downs. R700 is a 1 kohm pull-up on FPGA_PUDC_N,\nmeeting the dedicated pin tie requirement. Configuration data pins sharing\nthis bank retain their named flash connections."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 82.273 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
