	(text "IO3V3 supplies FIFO I/O and 3.3 V pins. FT1V0, FT_PLL1V0 and FT_A3V3 have\nseparate local bypass, with ferrite filtering for the analog groups. USB5 supplies\nthe Type-C controller. USB_VBUS and USB5 remain distinct named nets in the\nschematic."
